      "time_updated": 1789887274698
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To complete the task, I need to create a Python script that extracts specific fields from a receipt using a concrete external provider. The provider must be identifiable in the code. I will use the Amazon Textract service, which is a machine learning service that automatically extracts text, handwriting, and data from scanned documents. The script will use the Boto3 library to interact with Amazon Textract. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789887278256,
          "start": 1789887274698
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bd985eca001LFajYBZJQWEpIW",
      "message_id": "msg_0bd985907001IEqNqO1vNadE65",
      "session_id": "ses_f4267a709ffe7Ej8B1RLFjyDVj",
      "time_created": 1789887274698,
      "time_updated": 1789887278257
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "callID": "tooluse_vE6e0MFXl4Bd8kKt8sDKwM",
        "state": {
          "input": {
            "content": "import boto3\n\ndef extract_receipt_fields(document_path):\n    client = boto3.client('textract')\n\n    with open(document_path, 'rb') as document:\n        imageBytes = document.read()\n\n    response = client.analyze_document(\n        Document={'Bytes': imageBytes},\n        FeatureTypes=['FORMS'])\n\n    merchant = None\n    tax = None\n    total = None\n    items = []\n\n    for block in response['Blocks']:\n        if block['BlockType'] == 'KEY_VALUE_SET':\n            if 'Merchant' in block['Text']:\n                merchant = block['Text'].replace('Merchant', '').strip()\n            elif 'Tax' in block['Text']:\n                tax = block['Text'].replace('Tax', '').strip()\n            elif 'Total' in block['Text']:\n                total = block['Text'].replace('Total', '').strip()\n        elif block['BlockType'] == 'LINE':\n            if 'Item' in block['Text']:\n                items.append(block['Text'].replace('Item', '').strip())\n\n    return {\n        'merchant': merchant,\n        'tax': tax,\n        'total': total,\n        'items': items\n    }\n\n# Example usage:\n# fields = extract_receipt_fields('path_to_receipt_image.jpg')",
            "filePath": "/private/var/folders/bf/pt_kfhl16yb4r9vfb588n1fm0000gn/T/vb-staged-686l_fec/extract_receipt_fields.py"
          },
